  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2003 CONVENTION: Capacity-Building of Member States</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The previous biennium&#x2019;s emphasis on promoting multinational nominations has yielded encouraging progress, with a growing number of multinational nominations from Southeast Asian Member States either already submitted or currently under preparation. UNESCO Jakarta will continue to monitor these developments and build on this growing interest to foster innovative collaborative projects among States Parties.
Efforts will also be made to mobilise resources for pilot initiatives that integrate traditional knowledge and skills into mainstream policies and practices, including education curricula, food systems, and disaster risk reduction.</narrative>
  </description>
